  "note": "c₁: I₁ gives 1, I₂ at β = π/8 gives 2^{1/4}(2/(1+sin²(π/8)))^{σ/2}, and I₃ at β = π/8 uses (1−tan²(π/8))/4 = (√2−1)/2. Erratum: For rho <= 3/2, c_2 in (8.42) takes the smaller of the beta = pi/6 and beta = pi/5 I_2 terms but always adds the beta = pi/6 I_3 term, although one contour has a single beta. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_8_42.py`)."
